 no additional artifact discovery [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]for prompts that do not use it.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202609/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]wait_artifacts.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202609/wait_artifacts.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-x8[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-x8/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Add a batched Rust query for waited producers' artifact [/bold #D7AFFF]      [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]metadata[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]artifact-query[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]artifact-query: implement the exact-producer metadata contract in Rust, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]its Python binding and thin adapter, and isolation tests.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Expose the wait namespace at the runtime rendering boundary[/bold #D7AFFF]   [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]wait-context[dim] · [dim][/dim]after artifact-query[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]wait-context: share waited-producer resolution, inject wait.chats and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]lazy wait.artifacts without serializing the resolver, and update [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]documentation and static prompt tooling.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Register research reports and pass their paths to the lead[/bold #D7AFFF]    [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]research-handoff[dim] · [dim][/dim]after wait-context[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]research-handoff: register reports through the existing artifact [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]command, replace the lead's transcript input with report metadata, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]verify the complete producer-to-consumer flow.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-x8","llm_provider":"claude","model":"sonnet","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-x8.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-2ca211b4e24bac8683e8ed2d57eecc4d","started_at":"2026-09-05T23:27:48.456257+00:00","state":"active"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"c38cb59592517fb990a05c46878d5ce40de865010083ed42aef1d5cfd6ee95dc","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-x8.land--plan/chat.md","size_bytes":5658},"commits":{"digest":"ae05c8a6e4ec099e05ffa596de49f4a8f26b411fa33e7fb13a0cc607024ef995","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-x8.land--plan/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"a398c70160fe308637edd70b38d8cf02cc697183c480675d10f387d529663058","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-x8.land--plan/embedded_workflows.json","size_bytes":80},"meta":{"digest":"d74dd378bd962c2e7eb5853d1e15c3bbb740579bbe0f6a93745793afaac90443","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-x8.land--plan/meta.json","size_bytes":791},"prompt":{"digest":"0b16a7c062897c547006a42fc8b1656f1023f2742a2ffc7c6d74ea5d6ec849e5","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-x8.land--plan/prompt.md","size_bytes":191},"state":{"digest":"44a99e7de3de182b6219279c855fea6a0660f9720cfd1da42ee64bd9548c992b","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-x8.land--plan/state.json","size_bytes":180}},"finished_at":null,"global_name":"bbugyi200.athena.sase-x8.land--plan","local_name":"sase-x8.land--plan","metadata":{"agent_clan":"sase-x8","agent_clan_generation":"20260905192726","agent_session":"sase-x8.land","agent_session_role":"plan","approve":true,"bead_id":"sase-x8","changespec_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","cl_name":"gh_sase